TAMLINUX-PACKAGES

Public delivery definitions for Tamlinux
<https://github.com/greenermoose/tamlinux>, tamlinux-tools
<https://github.com/greenermoose/tamlinux-tools>, tam
<https://github.com/greenermoose/tam>, tam-edit, tam-data, and libtam
<https://github.com/greenermoose/libtam>.

This repository records exact source-install delivery receipts under
<deliveries/> for Test and Run. Gate A closed with released 0.4.8 and Blue
Sparkler released as 0.5.12; dev continues on 0.6 (KBN WB). Product
source lives in the component repositories; bespoke Tamlinux software builds
and installs directly from pinned Git commits with `make` and `make install`
(Nix, Home Manager, and `tam-bundle` are retired).

The deployment contract <docs/deployment.md> requires Test and Run to install
a recorded candidate delivery built from pinned Git commits. Login is
console-first <docs/console-startup.md>. See docs/README <docs/README> for
the operational doc index.

Source behavior and ordinary build interfaces belong in their component
repositories. Delivery records and rootstock package verification belong
here.

GNU GPL v3 or later. See <LICENSE> and AI blame <AI-BLAME.md>.

Software defect tracker <bugs/README-bugs.md>: report reproducible defects
beside their source.
